# Love Revealed — environment (Parents Day 2026)
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. Every var is optional for local dev: with
# none set, the app uses an in-memory repository and leaves the admin gate open,
# so all three surfaces (/, /led, /admin) are reachable without config.

# Upstash Redis (Vercel Marketplace) — the single source of truth: love-style
# counters, family records, and the append-only submission log the LED polls
# (ADR-0001). Absent ⇒ in-memory repository (dev only; not shared across
# serverless invocations in production).
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# Shared secret gating /admin and /led in Routing Middleware (ADR-0006);
# participant routes stay open. Absent ⇒ gate open (dev). Production MUST set it.
# Reach a gated route once with ?key=<secret> to mint the operator cookie.
ADMIN_SECRET=
